                <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> ;
                <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/semiFormalNaturalLanguageDefinition> "b is a subsystem of a at all times = Def for all times t ((a is a system) & (b is a system) & (b proper continuant part of a at t))."@en .


###  https://www.w3id.org/climoo/climoo-piccomela#ClimOO_0000366
:ClimOO_0000366 rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000111> ,
