[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> ;
   owl:annotatedProperty owl:equivalentClass ;
   owl:annotatedTarget <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> ;
   rdfs:comment """ClimOO Ontology comment:
We mapped PROVO and BFO classes in compliance with the PROVO-BFO alignment, which can be found at the following link: https://github.com/BFO-Mappings/PROV-to-BFO 

Bibliographic reference: Prudhomme, T., De Colle, G., Liebers, A., Sculley, A., Xie, P., Cohen, S., & Beverley, J. A semantic approach to mapping the Provenance Ontology to Basic Formal Ontology. Sci Data 12, 282 (2025). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-025-04580-1"""@en
 ] .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062> rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062> ;
   owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:subClassOf ;
   owl:annotatedTarget <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> ;
   rdfs:comment """ClimOO Ontology comment:
In agreement with UBERON, we reclassify this class as a subclass of the \"material entity\" class."""@en
 ] .


