###  https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Entity
<https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Entity> rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001> .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource <https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Entity> ;
   owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:subClassOf ;
   owl:annotatedTarget <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001> ;
   rdfs:comment """ClimOO Ontology comment:
I-ADOPT defines the class “entity” as “an object or process that has a role in an observation,” while BFO defines this class as “anything that exists or has existed or will exist.” I-ADOPT class presents a narrower coverage compared to the BFO class, resulting in mapping the first as a subclass of the other. We established this mapping after discussion with and approval from a TransformON designer and curator.
https://github.com/bfo-ontology/BFO-2020
https://i-adopt.github.io/ontology/index.html#/Entity"""@en
 ] .


###  https://www.w3id.org/climoo/climoo-piccomela#ClimOO_0000004
:ClimOO_0000004 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( :ClimOO_0000028
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <https://www.w3id.org/sco#SCO_0000038> ;
                                                             owl:someValuesFrom [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                  owl:unionOf ( :ClimOO_0000040
                                                                                                :ClimOO_0000048
                                                                                              )
                                                                                ]
                                                           ]
                                                         ) ;
                                      rdf:type owl:Class
                                    ] ;
                rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/sco#SCO_0000034> ;
                rdfs:label "agricultural system agent"@en ;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An agricultural system component that is an agent in an interaction among agricultural system components or in an interaction between agricultural system components and agricultural system environment components."@en ;
                <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Released> .


