:ClimOO_0000594 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_33582> ;
                rdfs:comment "We recreated this class on the basis of the corresponding ChEBI class. ChEBI axiomatizes upper-level classes of this class with respect to the carbon atom class, which presents axioms beyond the purposes of ClimOO. We envision discussions with subject matter experts. This class may be deprecated in favor of a more general class implemented in ChEBI after discussions. We subsume this class under the ChEBI carbon group molecular entity class, which is a direct upper-level class of the corresponding ChEBI class, and it is imported in ClimOO-SDC2."@en ;
                rdfs:label "volatile organic compounds"@en ;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A carbon group molecular entity that is an organic compound with an initial boiling point less than or equal to 250 °C (482 °F). The measurement is done at the standard atmospheric pressure of 101.3 kPa."@en ;
                <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/adaptedFrom> "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_134179" ;
